THE DIFF OF LB/tools AGAINST BS2/tools, HUNK BY HUNK (logs/tools_vs_bs2.diff: cd S2/r10round && diff -ruN
-x score_bs.py -x test_score_bs.py -x __pycache__ bias_screen2/tools long_blind/tools; 85 hunks)
Files with NO hunk (byte-identical to BS2's, cmp): bs_hooks.py (THE ARM HOOK, unchanged), verify_copy.py,
tests/test_bs_hooks.py.  Not copied (the criteria lane's): score_bs.py, tests/test_score_bs.py.

